# =============================================================================
# .gitignore — Cornus florida common-garden manuscript repository
#
# This folder is the publication repo (code in R/, anonymized data in data/,
# manuscript in *.md). The rules below keep out of history:
#   1. everything private — it all lives in SENSITIVE/ (one line)
#   2. regenerable pipeline output (data/derived/, data/results/, genepop scratch)
#   3. the usual R / RMarkdown / Quarto / renv / editor / OS noise
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Everything not for GitHub lives here: non-anonymized source data
#    (SENSITIVE/data_raw/), the de-anonymization key, working/process notes
#    (SENSITIVE/notes/), and the legacy repos (SENSITIVE/legacy/).
#    Keep this folder in a local Documents backup, never push it.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
/SENSITIVE/

# belt-and-braces in case a key or de-anon file lands outside SENSITIVE/
**/mom_anonymization_key.csv
**/*anonymization*key*
*_deanon.csv

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Generated analysis output — everything a fresh checkout rebuilds from
#    data/*.csv with `Rscript R/run_all.R`. Both folders are pipeline output:
#    data/derived/ = intermediates the model scripts consume; data/results/ =
#    the result tables (also rendered into manuscript.md).
#    The one committed exception is data/admixture.csv — it derives from the
#    non-public voucher panel, so a clone cannot rebuild it.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
/data/derived/
/data/results/

# genepop scratch (step 04); run_all.R and 04_null_alleles.R delete these on
# exit — this is the safety net if a run is interrupted.
/cmdline.txt
/fichier.in
/Rplots.pdf

# media/ (manuscript figures + diagnostics/) IS tracked, so manuscript.md
# renders on GitHub without running R. Uncomment to treat it as build output:
# /media/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. R
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history
.RData
.Ruserdata
.Renviron
*.Rout
*_cache/
/cache/
.Rprofile.local

# R CMD check / package builds (harmless if this never becomes a package)
/*.Rcheck/
*.tar.gz
/..Rcheck/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. renv  (keep renv.lock, renv/activate.R, renv/settings.json)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
/renv/library/
/renv/local/
/renv/cellar/
/renv/lock/
/renv/python/
/renv/sandbox/
/renv/staging/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. RMarkdown
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.knit.md
*.utf8.md
*.html
!/docs/**/*.html
/*_files/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 6. Quarto
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
/.quarto/
/_site/
/_book/
/_freeze/
/site_libs/
*_files/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 7. pandoc / LaTeX intermediates (manuscript -> .docx / .pdf conversion)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
*.bbl
*.blg
*.run.xml
# built manuscript documents (regenerate from the .md sources)
/*.docx
/*.pdf

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 8. Editors / IDEs
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.code-workspace
*~
.\#*
\#*\#
*.swp
*.swo

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 9. macOS / Windows / Linux
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini

.posit


